`dnCore Cm`: pop `rNB = 37`, `rM = 39`, `rTOT = 40`, pop `2 |cs|` entries of `rC = 45` (loop on
`rNC = 38`, counter `Cm`), pop `38`. `dn0 Cm = dnCore Cm`; `dn7 Cm` also pops `rK1 = 41`, `rK2 = 42`.
